    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuild? how is that even possible? i'm 29. i've put everything into this. my whole identity is this research. if the research is gone, then i'm just... nothing. the shame is so heavy i can barely breathe. i look at my peers and they're all so far ahead, and here i am, just a mistake. it feels like the universe is telling me i don't belong here. like there's just no way back from this.",
